/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The cement industry faces unprecedented changes over the next 25 years in the course of a transition to a decarbonised future. Many of the factors that will have a large impact by 2050 are still in an early stage and timing of their impact is uncertain. This forecast looks at what that impact might be and challenges the assumptions behind some of the more commonly cited long term forecasts. Key takeaways are:)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
