/S /P
/E (Cement demand in China has fallen almost 25% from 2.4 billion tonnes in 2020 to 1.8 billion tonnes in 2024, a decline of 7% p.a. We expect demand to continue to fall by 3.9% p.a. to 1.2 billion tonnes in 2035 and then at a slower 1.6% p.a. to 0.9 million tonnes by 2050 reflecting both lower per capita consumption and a decline in population. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
