320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many companies are exploring and developing non-clinker binder systems, mainly based on geopolymer concretes with steel slag, mine tailings and other industrial byproducts. These are likely to be accepted initially for non-structural and sub-surface applications. These applications which typically use C30 or standard grade concrete and have low risk/loss in the case of failure are estimated to amount to more than 50% of all concrete used. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
