441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For the cement industry, the worst option to reduce carbon emissions is CCS. It is expensive and energy intensive. Projects involve a range of parties, making for complex coordination. Furthermore, projects take a long time and often suffer delays. However, we do not have another way of getting to net zero.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
